# Windsurf Rules for PDF-Translate Skill
# High-fidelity vector PDF translation, layout preservation, and automated audit.

# Execution Workflow:
1. Document structure & geometry inspection via PyMuPDF (page.rect, get_image_rects, get_drawings)
2. Two-stage schema extraction (clause numbers, parameters, table dictionaries) before translation
3. HTML5 + CSS reconstruction: `@page { size: <source size>; margin: 0 }`, one `.page` = one physical sheet (padding for margins, overflow: hidden)
4. Playwright headless render with recursive overflow probe: `python scripts/render_pdf.py in.html out.pdf --strict-overflow`
5. Mandatory page-by-page audit: `python scripts/audit_pdf.py --src original.pdf --tgt out.pdf --compare-png compare_png/`
6. Fix every CRITICAL issue, review WARNINGs, show comparison PNGs to the user before delivery
